 "idx": 0,
 "introduction_text": "<div class=\"ql-editor read-mode\"><p><strong>Nikki Expense Tracker &amp; Reimbursements</strong></p><p>Any time you spend <strong>YOUR OWN</strong> money on something for the business put it here. Any time you pull from cash to reimburse yourself you will put as money coming in so your owed from Motley goes down!</p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Expense Type </strong>- Personal or Motley's Expense.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Transaction date</strong> - date of the receipt, invoice, or cash ledger.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Money In</strong> - ONLY fill this out if you collected money.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Money Out</strong> - ONLY fill this out if you spent money.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Company </strong>- MTPZ (greenhouse), Motley Terpz (extracts, branding, etc), or TSBC (outdoor farm). If unsure - contact Jamie.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Receipt</strong> - upload the receipt, cash form, etc when Motley Expense.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Transaction notes</strong> - add any additional notes here</li></ol><p><br></p></div>",
